      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly meal planning\nSaturday 09:00. Asks the hub for a draft plan for next week's empty slots (cloud AI if configured, otherwise the built-in planner). The draft is **not** written to Mealie: someone reviews and saves it on /meals. A notification is added to the hub's feed.",
